  lines:
  - text: 'Ok... We''ll get you through this! Just listen closely! We need to break
      his shield!  '
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: Its a good thing CR didn't take away our healthcare!
    correctID: 2
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b941eaeefd6c7445ab899bb478c0b17, type: 2}
  - text: 'Aeri, now would be a good time to use your "Whirlwind" ability! It should
      block the projectiles! '
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: 'You still trust me even though... nevermind... '
    correctID: 3
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10443583e9eddbb4f862c7d83b067b15, type: 2}
  - text: 'I learned what I need to know for now. Thank you guys and see you all
      later! '
    correctID: 7
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a700304b2b567094e9506d5f83fc8ed5, type: 2}
